{"steam_appid":1366800,"steam_name":"Crosshair X","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1366800/100071116/63859393ab6820aeae5538ef054ce02afdbf7efb/1750123110/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1750124158","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256818282/01f5c811edb1689a4bf5d076bce6a0539d80e867/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1750124158","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1366800/04d77a8b92fb85bf3dcbac7732f93729400f8ed3/ss_04d77a8b92fb85bf3dcbac7732f93729400f8ed3.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783870581","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1366800/ffa244195b88dc52c9a2279a4e8ef413fe0cb7b0/ss_ffa244195b88dc52c9a2279a4e8ef413fe0cb7b0.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783870581","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1366800/2fa1058bb114d9aecedd332c7d5af0aad1c600bf/ss_2fa1058bb114d9aecedd332c7d5af0aad1c600bf.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783870581","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1366800/b77929230783f98d6349024bf6f0bc0ba215d14d/ss_b77929230783f98d6349024bf6f0bc0ba215d14d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783870581","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1366800/46cb4c23fd0f49bdf5907cbc544f1234e84c1ab1/ss_46cb4c23fd0f49bdf5907cbc544f1234e84c1ab1.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783870581"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1366800/extras/8a0b4808e8aa3b16beb892f7b56326e7.poster.avif?t=1783870581\" width=1000 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1366800/extras/8a0b4808e8aa3b16beb892f7b56326e7.webm?t=1783870581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1366800/extras/8a0b4808e8aa3b16beb892f7b56326e7.mp4?t=1783870581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A custom crosshair for every game you play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crosshair X overlays your own custom crosshair on top of any game you play, even games that do not include one. Improve your aim and accuracy in first-person shooters, third-person shooters, battle royales, survival games, and anything else you play on PC.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rated <strong>Very Positive</strong> with over 41,000 reviews on Steam, Crosshair X is the most popular crosshair overlay on PC.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thousands of community designs.</strong> Browse and download crosshairs shared by the Crosshair X community, with new designs added every day.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Precision designer.</strong> Build your own crosshair from scratch with controls for lines, dot, outline, color, opacity, and animations. Upload any image to use as your crosshair.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Works in every game.</strong> Compatible with first-person shooters, third-person games, survival titles, and single-player adventures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exclusive fullscreen support.</strong> Show your crosshair even in games that block third-party overlays, through the official Xbox Game Bar.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Workshop.</strong> Subscribe to crosshairs from the Steam Workshop and publish your own designs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multi-monitor support.</strong> Choose which monitor to display the crosshair on, and save the crosshair position for each game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Save and switch.</strong> Save unlimited crosshairs and switch between them in seconds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Smart toggle.</strong> Show or hide your crosshair with a custom keyboard shortcut, or hide it automatically when you right-click to aim down sights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Share with friends.</strong> Share any crosshair with a single code, or export it as an image file.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Available in 17 languages.</strong> English, Spanish, French, German, Italian, Portuguese, Russian, Japanese, Korean, Chinese, Turkish, Polish, Swedish, Czech, Danish, and Ukrainian.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >More Videos</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1366800/extras/3e3a63b9c21be6c2b0806a85c0ac3302.poster.avif?t=1783870581\" width=1000 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1366800/extras/3e3a63b9c21be6c2b0806a85c0ac3302.webm?t=1783870581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1366800/extras/3e3a63b9c21be6c2b0806a85c0ac3302.mp4?t=1783870581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1366800/extras/6abb82af57d8dd17f3b9447d7ae8f026.poster.avif?t=1783870581\" width=1000 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1366800/extras/6abb82af57d8dd17f3b9447d7ae8f026.webm?t=1783870581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1366800/extras/6abb82af57d8dd17f3b9447d7ae8f026.mp4?t=1783870581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/136